  "uuid": "e6f11e71-5b15-4f09-ae9c-a7bd060303d3",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "e6f2e22a-3951-1ae1-e2d0-c2e70983dffc",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "0d543a47-fa0f-4cd9-7eaf-771b31c3a030",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "An increasing number of homes in the city are turning away NNS teams with the refusal rate in some areas standing at more than double the figure in the previous survey in 2011. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Zainab Danish, a Karachi-based research supervisor on the NNS, is aware of the innate challenges of conducting door-to-door research in the busy metropolis. \"Insecurity is one of the big issues,\" says Ms Danish. \"Despite carrying cards [to identify ourselves], people fear that we are burglars at their door.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
